WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.846
In under two minutes, you will vote for your favorite homes in a neighborhood contest.

00:00:04.846 --> 00:00:05.868
We start on the map.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.102
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.827 --> 00:00:14.249
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.249 --> 00:00:16.739
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.739 --> 00:00:18.085
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.832 --> 00:00:22.048
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.048 --> 00:00:22.700
Tap Allow.

00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:28.754
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.754 --> 00:00:29.971
See the three dots?

00:00:29.971 --> 00:00:30.519
Tap them.

00:00:32.126 --> 00:00:34.089
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:35.793 --> 00:00:37.316
Under Live now, tap Vote.

00:00:37.316 --> 00:00:40.011
The first time, the site asks you to sign in.

00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:42.179
That keeps it to one vote per person.

00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:45.719
Want to see the homes first?

00:00:45.719 --> 00:00:49.471
Visit the homes puts them in a few driving routes, in your maps app.

00:00:50.794 --> 00:00:52.810
Every home is in every category.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:55.682
In Best Traditional, tap Vote on your favorite.

00:00:57.611 --> 00:00:59.788
The next category opens by itself.

00:00:59.788 --> 00:01:02.464
Tap Vote on your favorite creative display.

00:01:04.392 --> 00:01:05.930
Last, Best Animated.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.248
Tap your favorite.

00:01:09.647 --> 00:01:10.715
Thanks for voting!

00:01:10.715 --> 00:01:13.300
You can change your vote until voting closes.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.998
Tap Share this contest to send it to a neighbor.

00:01:17.722 --> 00:01:19.661
Next up: Judge a contest.
